/Title (This project is an FPGA-based system that was completed as a group assignment for a core unit \(MTRX3700: Mechatronics 3\). This project processes live audio input through a microphone stream, and maps the BPM, beat detection and high, mid, low frequency bands to image filtering operations on a VGA output display. My contribution to this group project was the VGA controller, image rendering pipeline, 5x5 convolution filter, weighted sum based convolution kernel scaling, as well as the intensity and hue pixelwise image filters.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 841 0 R
>>
endobj
